# Netlify redirects (2026-10-24, fight-load fix). This file lives in the
# publish directory (game/), which is where Netlify reads redirect/rewrites
# for post-processing — the matching [[redirects]] in game/netlify.toml are
# kept in sync as the base-dir copy.
# The Netlify site publishes game/ as its root, but fighter models and other
# runtime files live outside game/ on the gh-pages layout (roster/,
# customization/, packages/, game/ refs). These 200 proxy rewrites make those
# paths resolve on Netlify exactly as they do on GitHub Pages. Publish-dir
# files always win (no force); only missing paths fall through to the proxy.
/roster/*  https://mhvnsnt.github.io/western-heart/roster/:splat  200
/customization/*  https://mhvnsnt.github.io/western-heart/customization/:splat  200
/packages/*  https://mhvnsnt.github.io/western-heart/packages/:splat  200
/game/*  https://mhvnsnt.github.io/western-heart/game/:splat  200
